      "jp": "モンスター娘たちが生息しているゲシュペンス島。\nそこへ上陸した私たちはさっそく標的を見つけたのだが――。",
      "jp_sha256": "22a55d265708c898ba2aa707d390aedc03ebd43dbb5e4e01f35397bee759752b",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "몬스터 소녀들이 사는 게슈펜스 섬.\n그곳에 상륙한 우리는 곧바로 표적을 찾았지만――.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 8,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "722b6584baa534746dfce45fa89c81bdee7fa83c1fb032db2dc1cc3e127d7f8e:000002_7327617426620618079:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "モンスター娘たちが生息しているゲシュペンス島。\nそこへ上陸した私たちはさっそく標的を見つけたのだが――。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "e1b8c409bff1c3cf33b80cf50bbc665cc85c756d7bd06938246c9b2765b00ef2",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "本当に最悪だわ……。あいつら、あれでも冒険者なの？　\nゴブリンが群れで現れたからって、\n私を置いてさっさと逃げ出すなんて！！",
      "jp_sha256": "e51b621c3dc3c20f4121f35e85edb6023dbd4b83b55178af3ed5af57439c2bb5",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "정말 최악이야……. 저것들도 모험가야?\n고블린이 무리 지어 나타났다고\n나를 두고 재빨리 도망치다니!!",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 20,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b001-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
